 "diagnosis": "The loop invariant is missing an upper bound on 'high'. The invariant '0 <= low <= high + 1' combined with the loop guard 'low <= high' gives '0 <= low <= high' but does not bound high by arr.Length. Therefore Dafny cannot prove that mid = (low + high) / 2 satisfies 0 <= mid < arr.Length when accessing arr[mid]. An invariant like 'high < arr.Length' is needed to bound mid from above."}

